1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:02,280
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:03,892
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,892 --> 00:00:04,920
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 13=

5
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:09,800
Mr. Gu,

6
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,240
I'll get straight to the point.

7
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:13,400
The project Hu was handling

8
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,160
has run into trouble.

9
00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:15,880
Bei Ruo's taking over.

10
00:00:16,559 --> 00:00:17,839
She'll be at Gu Group in three days.

11
00:00:18,280 --> 00:00:19,519
Please don't make things hard for her.

12
00:00:19,879 --> 00:00:20,600
So you'll come to me

13
00:00:21,079 --> 00:00:21,920
for someone else's sake?

14
00:00:22,519 --> 00:00:23,519
She's my colleague.

15
00:00:24,039 --> 00:00:25,559
I don't want her to lose her job.

16
00:00:28,879 --> 00:00:29,640
I'll agree,

17
00:00:30,359 --> 00:00:31,199
on one condition.

18
00:00:33,079 --> 00:00:33,679
What condition?

19
00:00:34,280 --> 00:00:36,560
If I approve her work,

20
00:00:37,039 --> 00:00:37,520
Hua,

21
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:38,960
will you move back home?

22
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,079
Please?

23
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:42,479
That's your price for helping her?

24
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,600
I don't know why

25
00:00:44,640 --> 00:00:46,880
you're pleading for someone
you barely know.

26
00:00:47,159 --> 00:00:47,719
But I do know

27
00:00:48,600 --> 00:00:49,479
you came to me

28
00:00:50,240 --> 00:00:51,719
because you want this to work out.

29
00:00:52,240 --> 00:00:52,679
Right?

30
00:00:53,479 --> 00:00:54,520
Are you

31
00:00:55,439 --> 00:00:56,039
forcing me?

32
00:00:56,359 --> 00:00:57,399
I'm trying to reason with you.

33
00:00:58,320 --> 00:00:59,119
Mom misses you.

34
00:00:59,880 --> 00:01:01,119
She thinks we've had a fight

35
00:01:01,439 --> 00:01:02,320
and wants us to make up.

36
00:01:03,039 --> 00:01:03,719
Lately,

37
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,239
she hasn't been sleeping well.

38
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:12,079
Xifeng,

39
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,079
make a detour to S&D.

40
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,480
The driver's been complaining

41
00:01:17,799 --> 00:01:19,079
about getting up an hour earlier.

42
00:01:19,799 --> 00:01:21,000
Now I know why.

43
00:01:21,519 --> 00:01:22,560
Give him a raise.

44
00:01:22,959 --> 00:01:23,519
Thank you, sir.

45
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:24,760
Sir,

46
00:01:26,239 --> 00:01:28,640
will you keep your marriage
a secret forever?

47
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:31,879
She's not ready.

48
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,359
I'll wait.

49
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:35,319
You're so good to her.

50
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,159
She's bound to fall for you.

51
00:01:38,319 --> 00:01:38,920
Then

52
00:01:39,480 --> 00:01:40,719
you can finally

53
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:42,599
take her home to meet your grandma.

54
00:01:51,240 --> 00:01:52,840
(Calling Mrs. Xie)

55
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:07,760
(Are you there?)

56
00:02:11,080 --> 00:02:11,599
(What are you doing?)

57
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,000
Miss Xie.

58
00:02:21,719 --> 00:02:22,360
(Xifeng,)

59
00:02:22,919 --> 00:02:24,000
(can you come to Jiaye Restaurant)

60
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,159
(and pick me up?)

61
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:26,879
But I...

62
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:27,879
Go get her.

63
00:02:30,039 --> 00:02:30,319
Of course.

64
00:02:30,919 --> 00:02:31,599
I'll be right there.

65
00:02:35,919 --> 00:02:36,400
Okay,

66
00:02:37,319 --> 00:02:37,800
Mr. Gu.

67
00:02:38,360 --> 00:02:39,520
But I can only stay for a week.

68
00:02:40,159 --> 00:02:40,599
Of course,

69
00:02:40,840 --> 00:02:41,639
you can say no.

70
00:02:42,479 --> 00:02:43,840
This is a deal, after all.

71
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,599
We both have to agree to it.

72
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:47,280
Whatever you say.

73
00:02:48,639 --> 00:02:49,280
Thank you, Mr. Gu.

74
00:02:49,919 --> 00:02:50,560
I'd better go.

75
00:02:51,120 --> 00:02:51,599
Hua,

76
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:53,080
I've agreed to your terms.

77
00:02:53,360 --> 00:02:54,439
Can't you stay and talk for a bit?

78
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,280
There's no need for that.

79
00:03:00,879 --> 00:03:02,120
Fine. Never mind.

80
00:03:02,639 --> 00:03:03,479
Let's walk around Jiangcheng Uni.

81
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,400
We have so many good memories there.

82
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,199
Mr. Gu,

83
00:03:06,639 --> 00:03:07,919
when will you understand?

84
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:10,199
We're history.

85
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,680
It's over.

86
00:03:12,120 --> 00:03:13,280
You married some random guy

87
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:14,639
just to get back at me, didn't you?

88
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:15,599
I admit it.

89
00:03:15,800 --> 00:03:16,520
It worked.

90
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:18,039
I'm jealous. I regret it.

91
00:03:18,199 --> 00:03:19,840
You can't read Xie Zhouhan.

92
00:03:20,240 --> 00:03:21,439
Please stay away from him.

93
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:23,280
All he can offer is money and power.

94
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,199
I have those, too.

95
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:25,919
Just wait for me.

96
00:03:26,439 --> 00:03:26,840
I...

97
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:29,639
Gu Zheng,

98
00:03:29,759 --> 00:03:30,919
have some shame.

99
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,280
Learn some boundaries.

100
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:33,879
You're engaged.

101
00:03:34,039 --> 00:03:35,080
And I'm married.

102
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,479
I'll beat him to a pulp.

103
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:42,960
Wait.

104
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,039
Let's go home.

105
00:03:58,319 --> 00:03:58,840
Hua.

106
00:04:00,080 --> 00:04:00,560
Bao'er.

107
00:04:00,919 --> 00:04:01,840
Why are you still up?

108
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,520
Hua,

109
00:04:03,719 --> 00:04:05,159
where were you today?

110
00:04:05,520 --> 00:04:07,560
Dad and I wanted to pick you up
for dinner.

111
00:04:09,120 --> 00:04:11,039
I didn't see his message until later.

112
00:04:11,319 --> 00:04:12,199
I was busy today,

113
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,319
so I didn't reply.

114
00:04:14,479 --> 00:04:15,360
Is your dad home?

115
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,160
He...

116
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:17,800
He went back to work.

117
00:04:18,839 --> 00:04:19,319
Hua,

118
00:04:19,680 --> 00:04:20,160
um...

119
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,120
Dad hasn't eaten dinner.

120
00:04:22,279 --> 00:04:23,560
Fen saved him some food.

121
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:26,600
Could you take him a late-night meal?

122
00:04:27,319 --> 00:04:28,800
Doesn't he have an assistant?

123
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,079
Hua,

124
00:04:31,519 --> 00:04:33,319
do you hate my dad?

125
00:04:33,800 --> 00:04:35,079
Don't be silly.

126
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:40,079
He definitely doesn't want to see me.

127
00:04:40,560 --> 00:04:41,720
But you're different.

128
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,639
He really, really wants to see you.

129
00:04:44,839 --> 00:04:46,399
Please.

130
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:47,959
I've packed the food for you.

131
00:04:48,079 --> 00:04:49,040
The car's downstairs, too.

132
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:50,879
Just drop it off and leave.

133
00:04:51,279 --> 00:04:51,680
Please?

134
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,040
But...

135
00:04:55,759 --> 00:04:56,959
will you come with me?

136
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:57,800
Me?

137
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,600
I won't be a third wheel.

138
00:04:59,839 --> 00:05:01,079
Thanks, Mommy.

139
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,279
Here.

140
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:21,480
Come in.

141
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,079
Mr. Xie,

142
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:35,600
Bao'er said you hadn't had dinner,

143
00:05:35,879 --> 00:05:36,959
so I brought you some food.

144
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:40,680
I'll leave it here

145
00:05:40,879 --> 00:05:41,759
and let you get back to work.

146
00:05:42,399 --> 00:05:42,759
Wait.

147
00:05:47,839 --> 00:05:49,560
You didn't come home for dinner.

148
00:05:53,959 --> 00:05:54,519
Something came up.

149
00:05:55,439 --> 00:05:56,639
I ate with a friend.

150
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:57,720
What friend?

151
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,399
I'll move back for a few days next week.

152
00:06:01,879 --> 00:06:02,399
To the Gu family's?

153
00:06:04,439 --> 00:06:06,000
Mrs. Wen says she misses me.

154
00:06:06,319 --> 00:06:07,480
And she hasn't been well.

155
00:06:07,879 --> 00:06:08,959
I'd like to spend time with her.

156
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:12,560
She was a good friend of my mom's.

157
00:06:13,199 --> 00:06:15,639
I was almost sent to an orphanage,

158
00:06:15,800 --> 00:06:17,399
but she brought me into the Gu family.

159
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,519
So...

160
00:06:20,439 --> 00:06:21,240
I owe them.

161
00:06:22,399 --> 00:06:22,800
Okay.

162
00:06:23,639 --> 00:06:24,240
How long?

163
00:06:25,279 --> 00:06:25,800
About a week.

164
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:40,319
Mr. Xie, what are you doing?

165
00:06:42,319 --> 00:06:43,639
My wife's going back to her family.

166
00:06:44,759 --> 00:06:45,759
What do you think I want to do?

167
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:04,440
♪You say you♪

168
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:06,400
♪Don't need anyone♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

169
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:09,800
♪You're just fine on your own♪

170
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:12,960
♪I see the pride behind your smile♪

171
00:07:13,080 --> 00:07:15,960
♪And the pain you face at night♪

172
00:07:16,720 --> 00:07:19,640
♪Sometimes love isn't about possession♪

173
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,800
♪It's tenderness that sets you free♪

174
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:25,880
♪Some love needs no promises♪

175
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:29,240
♪I'll face this cold world with you♪

176
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:31,920
♪I keep my feelings safely hidden♪

177
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:35,160
♪Quietly staying behind you♪

178
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:38,120
♪I'm right behind you♪

179
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:41,640
♪Shielding you from every hidden storm♪

180
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:44,280
♪Keeping the rain out of your eyes♪

181
00:07:44,280 --> 00:07:48,280
♪So you can walk ahead without fear♪

182
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:54,480
♪I'm right behind you♪

183
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:56,360
♪Waiting for you to turn around♪

184
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:58,200
♪Waiting for you to finally see♪

185
00:07:58,280 --> 00:08:00,640
♪You're the only one I lose control for♪

186
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,200
♪I'm right behind you♪

187
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:04,560
♪Loving you gently, though no one knows♪

188
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,320
♪I won't claim you♪

189
00:08:06,440 --> 00:08:08,000
♪I won't ask you to stay♪

190
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,680
♪I'll spend the rest of my life♪

191
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:14,040
♪Waiting for you♪
